    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="521dccdc-49f9-5ef1-92dc-5e0002428684" activityNameId="767d708a-56b7-544a-86d2-1a20db633fc5" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Silicon carbide, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Silicon carbide, at plant
Life cycle inventory for the production process based on raw material inputs and data for energy use and emissions.;
CAS number: 000409-21-2; 
Formula: SiC; 
Synonyms: silicon monocarbide, carborundum, carbolon; 
UUID: b873659c-2a9d-3ad9-bc76-e77fc2b4aef6
Gate to gate inventory for production of silicon carbide from silica sand. Including materials and electricity use. Some emissions to air from the process.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average technology data for 4 companies.
Time period: Time of publication.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature and internet. Average data from 4 companies. 
Extrapolations: Emission data extrapolated with total CO2 emissions.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b873659c-2a9d-3ad9-bc76-e77fc2b4aef6.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
